<tt xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.300"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">不就是现在吗？熊熊燃烧吧</text><text for="L2">那沉睡着的正义</text><text for="L3">就算是这样的我，也想成为你的英雄啊</text><text for="L4">对这么帅气的你来说，我是不是太不可靠了呢</text><text for="L5">那也难怪，毕竟我直到现在还这样迷茫着</text><text for="L6">你愿意牵起我的手吗？这是彼此付出、彼此回报啊</text><text for="L7">就像你曾经是我的英雄那样</text><text for="L8">不就是现在吗？熊熊燃烧着</text><text for="L9">连这样的我体内也潜藏着正义</text><text for="L10">被无法抑制的冲动驱使</text><text for="L11">看吧，回过神来，手已经握紧了</text><text for="L12">你到底背着这么多负担，要走向哪里？</text><text for="L13">喂，等等，分一点给我，试试看好吗？</text><text for="L14">一味相信的我，和害怕相信的你</text><text for="L15">究竟哪一方才是对的，谁也说不清啊</text><text for="L16">这是只属于我们的世界，彼此付出、彼此回报</text><text for="L17">等我们彼此补足的那天，想和你一起做同一个梦</text><text for="L18">我把你当成那么厉害的人，反而让你承受了痛苦，</text><text for="L19">让你孤零零的，这多少也是我的错吧。对不起，不过该看清的是真实。</text><text for="L20">现在正是我来救你的时候；别一个人扛着，相信我，依靠我吧</text><text for="L21">不就是现在吗？熊熊燃烧着</text><text for="L22">连这样的我体内也潜藏着正义</text><text for="L23">被无法抑制的冲动驱使</text><text for="L24">看吧，回过神来，手已经握紧了</text><text for="L25">我不能放着你不管，你背着这么多负担，要走向哪里？</text><text for="L26">就一点点，分一点给我，试试看好吗？</text><text for="L27">就算是这样的我，也想成为你的英雄啊</text></translation></translations><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>長屋晴子</songwriter><songwriter>小林壱誓</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mela!"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="緑黄色社会"/><amll:meta key="album" value="SINGALONG"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538137547"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:02.067"><div begin="0.623" end="15.132" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0.623" end="4.093" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.623" end="0.890">今</span><span begin="0.890" end="1.190">なん</span><span begin="1.190" end="1.446">じゃ</span><span begin="1.446" end="1.775">な</span><span begin="1.775" end="2.102">い？</span> <span begin="2.238" end="2.623">メラ</span><span begin="2.623" end="2.991">メラ</span><span begin="2.991" end="3.213">と</span><span begin="3.213" end="3.632">たぎ</span><span begin="3.632" end="4.093">れ</span></p><p begin="4.093" end="7.356" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.093" end="5.217">眠って</span><span begin="5.217" end="5.680">いる</span><span begin="5.680" end="6.043">だけ</span><span begin="6.043" end="6.284">の</span><span begin="6.284" end="6.708">正</span><span begin="6.708" end="7.356">義</span></p><p begin="7.356" end="15.132" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.356" end="8.020">こんな</span><span begin="8.020" end="8.991">僕も</span><span begin="9.138" end="9.778">君の</span><span begin="9.778" end="10.652">ヒーロー</span><span begin="10.696" end="10.934">に</span><span begin="10.934" end="11.513">なりた</span><span begin="11.513" end="11.914">い</span><span begin="11.914" end="12.291">の</span><span begin="12.291" end="15.132">さ</span></p></div><div begin="29.100" end="42.886" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.100" end="36.040" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.100" end="29.772">かっこ</span><span begin="29.772" end="30.314">いい</span><span begin="30.314" end="30.753">君</span><span begin="30.753" end="31.200">に</span><span begin="31.200" end="31.827">は</span> <span begin="32.011" end="32.374">僕</span><span begin="32.374" end="32.702">じゃ</span><span begin="32.702" end="33.306">頼り</span><span begin="33.306" end="33.836">ない</span><span begin="33.836" end="34.288">のか</span><span begin="34.288" end="34.665">なん</span><span begin="34.665" end="36.040">て</span></p><p begin="36.040" end="42.886" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.040" end="36.672">そりゃ</span><span begin="36.672" end="37.189">そう</span><span begin="37.189" end="37.743">だよな</span> <span begin="37.743" end="38.156">だっ</span><span begin="38.156" end="38.808">て</span><span begin="38.980" end="39.652">今も</span><span begin="39.652" end="40.539">こうして</span><span begin="40.539" end="41.147">迷</span><span begin="41.147" end="41.583">って</span><span begin="41.583" end="42.886">る</span></p></div><div begin="44.879" end="56.263" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.879" end="50.550" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.879" end="45.303">⼿を</span><span begin="45.303" end="45.734">取って</span><span begin="45.734" end="46.076">くれ</span><span begin="46.076" end="46.370">ない</span><span begin="46.370" end="46.864">か</span> <span begin="48.475" end="48.946">ギブ</span><span begin="48.946" end="49.150">と</span><span begin="49.150" end="49.758">テイク</span><span begin="49.758" end="50.550">さ</span></p><p begin="51.855" end="56.263" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.855" end="52.633">君が</span><span begin="52.633" end="53.247">僕の</span><span begin="53.247" end="54.193">ヒーロー</span><span begin="54.193" end="54.798">だった</span><span begin="54.798" end="55.013">よう</span><span begin="55.013" end="56.263">に</span></p></div><div begin="56.263" end="1:24.633" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="56.263" end="59.757" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.263" end="56.521">今</span><span begin="56.521" end="56.739">なん</span><span begin="56.739" end="56.956">じゃ</span><span begin="56.956" end="57.251">な</span><span begin="57.251" end="57.572">い？</span> <span begin="57.765" end="58.281">メラ</span><span begin="58.281" end="58.708">メラ</span><span begin="58.708" end="58.906">と</span><span begin="58.906" end="59.259">たぎ</span><span begin="59.259" end="59.757">る</span></p><p begin="59.757" end="1:03.222" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.757" end="1:00.179">こん</span><span begin="1:00.179" end="1:00.725">な</span><span begin="1:00.725" end="1:01.149">僕</span><span begin="1:01.149" end="1:01.572">にも</span><span begin="1:01.572" end="1:02.016">潜</span><span begin="1:02.016" end="1:02.229">む</span><span begin="1:02.229" end="1:02.815">正義</span><span begin="1:02.815" end="1:03.222">が</span></p><p begin="1:03.222" end="1:06.707" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.222" end="1:03.928">どうしようも</span><span begin="1:03.928" end="1:04.398">ない</span><span begin="1:04.856" end="1:05.642">衝動に</span><span begin="1:05.642" end="1:06.295">駆られ</span><span begin="1:06.295" end="1:06.707">て</span></p><p begin="1:06.707" end="1:10.235" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.707" end="1:07.202">ほら</span><span begin="1:07.202" end="1:08.290">気付けば</span><span begin="1:08.290" end="1:08.709">⼿を</span><span begin="1:08.709" end="1:09.597">握って</span><span begin="1:09.597" end="1:10.235">いる</span></p><p begin="1:10.235" end="1:16.933" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.235" end="1:10.686">いったい</span><span begin="1:10.686" end="1:10.992">ぜん</span><span begin="1:10.992" end="1:11.344">た</span><span begin="1:11.344" end="1:11.548">い</span> <span begin="1:11.634" end="1:12.546">そんなに</span><span begin="1:12.546" end="1:13.148">荷物</span><span begin="1:13.148" end="1:13.530">を</span><span begin="1:13.568" end="1:14.227">背負い</span><span begin="1:14.227" end="1:14.683">込</span><span begin="1:14.683" end="1:15.083">んで</span><span begin="1:15.083" end="1:15.457">ど</span><span begin="1:15.457" end="1:15.895">こへ</span><span begin="1:15.895" end="1:16.379">⾏く</span><span begin="1:16.379" end="1:16.933">の</span></p><p begin="1:16.933" end="1:24.633" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.933" end="1:17.704">ねえねえ</span><span begin="1:17.704" end="1:18.545">待って</span><span begin="1:18.743" end="1:19.391">僕に</span><span begin="1:19.391" end="1:20.218">ちょっと</span><span begin="1:20.316" end="1:21.091">預けて</span><span begin="1:21.091" end="1:21.525">み</span><span begin="1:21.525" end="1:21.765">て</span><span begin="1:21.765" end="1:24.633">は？</span></p></div><div begin="1:38.528" end="1:53.160" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:38.528" end="1:45.680" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.528" end="1:39.079">信</span><span begin="1:39.079" end="1:39.495">じて</span><span begin="1:39.495" end="1:40.256">ばかり</span><span begin="1:40.256" end="1:41.092">の</span><span begin="1:41.092" end="1:41.410">僕</span><span begin="1:41.410" end="1:41.647">と</span> <span begin="1:42.104" end="1:43.052">信じる</span><span begin="1:43.052" end="1:43.738">ことが</span><span begin="1:43.738" end="1:44.521">怖</span><span begin="1:44.521" end="1:44.818">い</span><span begin="1:44.818" end="1:45.084">君</span><span begin="1:45.084" end="1:45.680">と</span></p><p begin="1:45.680" end="1:53.160" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.680" end="1:46.436">どちらが</span><span begin="1:46.436" end="1:46.927">正</span><span begin="1:46.927" end="1:47.517">しい</span><span begin="1:47.910" end="1:48.525">のか</span><span begin="1:48.525" end="1:49.154">なんて</span> <span begin="1:49.154" end="1:49.855">誰</span><span begin="1:49.855" end="1:50.415">にも</span><span begin="1:50.667" end="1:51.227">分</span><span begin="1:51.227" end="1:51.913">から</span><span begin="1:51.913" end="1:52.302">ない</span><span begin="1:52.302" end="1:53.160">さ</span></p></div><div begin="1:54.473" end="2:10.448" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:54.473" end="2:00.044" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.473" end="1:55.170">僕ら</span><span begin="1:55.170" end="1:55.866">だけの</span><span begin="1:55.866" end="1:56.382">世</span><span begin="1:56.382" end="1:57.091">界</span> <span begin="1:58.058" end="1:58.555">ギブ</span><span begin="1:58.555" end="1:58.771">と</span><span begin="1:58.771" end="1:59.280">テイク</span><span begin="1:59.280" end="2:00.044">さ</span></p><p begin="2:01.498" end="2:10.448" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.498" end="2:02.393">補い</span><span begin="2:02.393" end="2:03.119">合えた</span><span begin="2:03.119" end="2:04.290">暁</span><span begin="2:04.290" end="2:04.545">に</span><span begin="2:04.545" end="2:04.916">は</span><span begin="2:05.048" end="2:05.730">同じ</span><span begin="2:05.730" end="2:06.581">夢を</span><span begin="2:06.581" end="2:07.298">⾒</span><span begin="2:07.298" end="2:07.509">た</span><span begin="2:07.509" end="2:10.448">い</span></p></div><div begin="2:21.418" end="2:50.312" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:21.418" end="2:28.693" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.418" end="2:22.146">君は</span><span begin="2:22.146" end="2:22.873">かっこ</span><span begin="2:22.873" end="2:23.486">いいと</span><span begin="2:23.670" end="2:24.534">苦し</span><span begin="2:24.534" end="2:25.199">めて</span> <span begin="2:25.353" end="2:26.166">ひとり</span><span begin="2:26.166" end="2:26.910">ぼっちに</span><span begin="2:26.910" end="2:27.182">さ</span><span begin="2:27.182" end="2:27.902">せ</span><span begin="2:28.025" end="2:28.693">たのは</span></p><p begin="2:28.693" end="2:38.850" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.693" end="2:29.374">少し</span><span begin="2:29.374" end="2:30.045">僕</span><span begin="2:30.045" end="2:30.535">の</span><span begin="2:30.535" end="2:31.545">せい</span><span begin="2:31.545" end="2:32.243">なんだ</span><span begin="2:32.466" end="2:33.195">よな</span><span begin="2:33.303" end="2:34.391">ごめん</span><span begin="2:34.391" end="2:35.123">ね</span> <span begin="2:35.123" end="2:35.868">だけど</span><span begin="2:35.868" end="2:36.412">⾒</span><span begin="2:36.412" end="2:37.125">るべきは</span><span begin="2:37.125" end="2:37.818">リアル</span><span begin="2:37.818" end="2:38.850">だ</span></p><p begin="2:38.850" end="2:50.312" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.850" end="2:39.343">今</span><span begin="2:39.343" end="2:39.956">こそ</span><span begin="2:39.956" end="2:40.613">僕が</span><span begin="2:40.749" end="2:41.182">救</span><span begin="2:41.182" end="2:41.819">け</span><span begin="2:41.819" end="2:42.168">るん</span><span begin="2:42.168" end="2:42.720">だ</span> <span begin="2:42.901" end="2:44.344">抱えないで</span><span begin="2:44.555" end="2:45.187">信</span><span begin="2:45.187" end="2:45.823">じて</span><span begin="2:45.890" end="2:47.022">頼って</span><span begin="2:47.242" end="2:47.921">ほしい</span><span begin="2:47.921" end="2:48.361">ん</span><span begin="2:48.361" end="2:50.312">だ</span></p></div><div begin="2:52.780" end="3:28.187" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:52.780" end="2:56.274" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.780" end="2:53.038">今</span><span begin="2:53.038" end="2:53.256">なん</span><span begin="2:53.256" end="2:53.473">じゃ</span><span begin="2:53.473" end="2:53.768">な</span><span begin="2:53.768" end="2:54.089">い？</span> <span begin="2:54.282" end="2:54.798">メラ</span><span begin="2:54.798" end="2:55.225">メラ</span><span begin="2:55.225" end="2:55.423">と</span><span begin="2:55.423" end="2:55.776">たぎ</span><span begin="2:55.776" end="2:56.274">る</span></p><p begin="2:56.239" end="2:59.704" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.239" end="2:56.661">こん</span><span begin="2:56.661" end="2:57.207">な</span><span begin="2:57.207" end="2:57.631">僕</span><span begin="2:57.631" end="2:58.054">にも</span><span begin="2:58.054" end="2:58.498">潜</span><span begin="2:58.498" end="2:58.711">む</span><span begin="2:58.711" end="2:59.297">正義</span><span begin="2:59.297" end="2:59.704">が</span></p><p begin="2:59.691" end="3:03.176" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.691" end="3:00.397">どうしようも</span><span begin="3:00.397" end="3:00.867">ない</span><span begin="3:01.325" end="3:02.111">衝動に</span><span begin="3:02.111" end="3:02.764">駆られ</span><span begin="3:02.764" end="3:03.176">て</span></p><p begin="3:03.230" end="3:06.758" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.230" end="3:03.725">ほら</span><span begin="3:03.725" end="3:04.813">気付けば</span><span begin="3:04.813" end="3:05.232">⼿を</span><span begin="3:05.232" end="3:06.120">握って</span><span begin="3:06.120" end="3:06.758">いる</span></p><p begin="3:06.726" end="3:13.477" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.726" end="3:07.199">ほって</span><span begin="3:07.199" end="3:07.572">おけ</span><span begin="3:07.572" end="3:07.949">ない</span> <span begin="3:08.306" end="3:09.114">そんなに</span><span begin="3:09.114" end="3:09.939">荷物を</span><span begin="3:10.120" end="3:10.637">背負い</span><span begin="3:10.637" end="3:11.126">込</span><span begin="3:11.126" end="3:11.462">んで</span><span begin="3:11.462" end="3:11.916">ど</span><span begin="3:11.916" end="3:12.342">こへ</span><span begin="3:12.342" end="3:12.733">⾏</span><span begin="3:12.733" end="3:13.477">くの</span></p><p begin="3:13.477" end="3:20.411" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.477" end="3:14.237">ほんの</span><span begin="3:14.237" end="3:14.938">ちょっと</span><span begin="3:15.271" end="3:15.932">僕に</span><span begin="3:15.932" end="3:16.672">ちょっと</span><span begin="3:16.751" end="3:17.628">預けて</span><span begin="3:17.628" end="3:18.040">み</span><span begin="3:18.040" end="3:18.249">て</span><span begin="3:18.249" end="3:20.411">は？</span></p><p begin="3:20.411" end="3:28.187" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.411" end="3:21.075">こんな</span><span begin="3:21.075" end="3:22.046">僕も</span><span begin="3:22.193" end="3:22.833">君の</span><span begin="3:22.833" end="3:23.655">ヒーロー</span><span begin="3:23.751" end="3:23.989">に</span><span begin="3:23.989" end="3:24.568">なりた</span><span begin="3:24.568" end="3:24.969">い</span><span begin="3:24.969" end="3:25.346">の</span><span begin="3:25.346" end="3:28.187">さ</span></p></div></body></tt>